# AI chat smoke requests.
# Works with JetBrains HTTP Client and VS Code REST Client style variables.
# Keep real credentials in local IDE environment variables or replace the placeholders locally.

@appBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@gatewayBaseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@gatewayToken = change-me
@chatModel = qwen3:8b
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@monitoringUsername = monitor
@monitoringPassword = monitor-secret

### Gateway chat completion: verify raw OpenAI-compatible usage
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}

{
  "model": "{{chatModel}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "토큰 사용량 테스트"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### App login: get accessToken for protected app APIs
# Replace username/password with an existing verified user.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### App AI chat: verify ChatController -> ChatService -> LLM path
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "message": "토큰 사용량 테스트"
}

### App AI chat validation: blank message should return 400
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "message": ""
}

### Actuator health: public
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Actuator prometheus: verify ai_text_generation_* metrics
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic {{monitoringUsername}} {{monitoringPassword}}
